.TH "TOOL-SERVE" "1" "September 28, 2026" "tool 2.3.1" "User Commands"
.SH "NAME"
tool\-serve \- run the dev server
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
\fBtool serve\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
run the dev server
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-c, \-\-config <path>\fR
Path to a config file; the default loader looks in the current
directory for .toolrc then walks up to home, and when missing it reads
\&.env instead of failing loudly (default: ".toolrc")
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
display help for command
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR tool (1),
.BR tool\-build (1),
.BR tool\-deploy (1),
.BR tool\-lint (1)
